      "Puntland state warned on Saturday about federal military deployments near Galkayo, citing risks to stability.",
      "Puntland accuses President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud of using military pressure to weaken its governance system.",
      "Recent clashes in Bosaso between federal and Puntland forces preceded the current friction.",
      "The Somali diaspora may be affected by potential instability in Puntland, a key region of origin."
